Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:00:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Wire the Backline QPM (backline-local) into the cluster

Adds a backline-head node, the backline-local service and --qpu mapping,
device and user entries, a backline environment module and a script that
creates the shared Backline venv. qfw-site-services gains an opt-in
backline target; 'all' is unchanged except that stop also stops a running
Backline QPM.
